    *(b)* Paired cross-modality linear (`Pearson r`) and rank (`Spearman` $rho$) concordance summary across all 13 hierarchical references (including `Mel+PanCa`, `NSCLC-Uni`, `Unified-All9`, and `Meta-42`; all $p <= 5 times 10^(-4)$ across $B = 2,000$ permutations).
